WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.968
-Welcome! Welcome, everybody.
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.934
You're here. You made it.
Thank you.

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:08.901
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you for watching.

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:10.667
Well, guys,
let's get to some news here.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.133
TikTok just announced
that all users under 18

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:16.467
will soon have their accounts
automatically set to

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:19.634
a one-hour daily
screen-time limit.

00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:23.400
[ Crowd boos ]

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.968
A TikTok limit is rough.

00:00:24.968 --> 00:00:26.801
Pretty soon,
kids will be forced to watch

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:28.901
slightly longer videos
on YouTube.

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:31.968
I mean that --
What is the world coming to?

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:33.334
But this is nice.

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:35.701
Facebook said, "If you need help
making kids quit your app,

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.200
let us know."

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:39.634
Some political news.

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.067
Today, a bipartisan group
of lawmakers

00:00:41.067 --> 00:00:46.067
reintroduced a bill to make
Daylight Savings Time permanent.

00:00:46.067 --> 00:00:48.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.467
Man, if Biden gets this done,

00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:54.067
there's no way
he's losing in 2024.

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:56.033
I'm telling you.
I have no idea what that is.

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:57.300
Get rid of that thing.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.934
"It's for the farmers."
Like, "No, it's not."

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.534
-No.
-They go, "It's for kids."

00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:03.434
You go, "No one knows why
we're doing this."

00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:04.501
An extra hour.

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:05.567
Right now, every kid's like,
"Sweet.

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.067
We're gonna get
an extra hour of TikTok.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.000
Awesome!"

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.667
All they have to do is
get Apple on board,

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:15.067
because whatever time my iPhone
says it is, that's the time.

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:18.000
Hey, I saw that House Democrats
are currently in Baltimore

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.868
