00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:24.701
Check out what some of them had
to say about the big retreat.

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:27.033
First up,
Congressman Josh Harder said...

00:01:38.133 --> 00:01:39.934
Congressman --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:45.033
Congressman Colin Allred said...

00:01:53.267 --> 00:01:55.667
Then Congresswoman
Susan Wild said...

00:02:03.534 --> 00:02:06.934
Buck wild.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:06.934 --> 00:02:09.834
Then Congressman Ed Case said...

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:19.667
Then Congressman
Jared Huffman said...

00:02:25.567 --> 00:02:29.000
Then Congresswoman
Lisa Blunt Ro--

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.200
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.234
-Lisa Blunt Rochester said...

00:02:40.567 --> 00:02:42.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:50.234
Then Congresswoman
Deborah Ross said...

00:02:57.934 --> 00:03:01.634
And, finally, Congressman
Dan Goldman said...

00:03:06.267 --> 00:03:08.901
But, anyway,
they had a fun time.

00:03:08.901 --> 00:03:12.234
That was -- [ Laughs ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:12.234 --> 00:03:14.100
Ah!

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:15.501
Some more political news.

00:03:15.501 --> 00:03:17.968
Today was the first big day
of speeches at the

00:03:17.968 --> 00:03:21.000
Conservative Political Action
Conference, CPAC.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.334
Of course, President Trump --

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:24.567
former president Trump
is attending CPAC.

00:03:24.567 --> 00:03:27.400
However, a lot of other
top Republicans aren't.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:29.501
But Trump said that's because...

00:03:35.033 --> 00:03:38.400
Trump was like,
"You can't repeat yourself.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.567
That's why
my campaign slogan is..."

00:03:44.501 --> 00:03:47.834
"Don't repeat yourself.
Don't do it."

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:51.801
Actually,
Trump's excited to be there.

00:03:51.801 --> 00:03:53.067
He actually spent all day
in the lobby

00:03:53.067 --> 00:03:55.000
signing copies of
his classified documents.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.801
-Oh.
-Yeah, it was cool.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:59.767
Switching gears,
some entertainment news.

00:03:59.767 --> 00:04:01.667
The third season
