00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.334
♪ What do you want? ♪

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:34.667
♪ What do you want? ♪
-♪ Can you fix it ♪

00:04:34.667 --> 00:04:36.234
-♪ What do you want? ♪

00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:37.901
-♪ Without the memory circuit? ♪
-♪ What do you want? ♪

00:04:37.901 --> 00:04:39.167
-♪ Can you ♪
♪ What do you want? ♪

00:04:39.167 --> 00:04:40.367
-♪ Fix it ♪
-♪ What do you want? ♪

00:04:40.367 --> 00:04:41.634
