-♪ Okay ♪

00:04:43.734 --> 00:04:45.767
-♪ He said he can't fix it ♪
-♪ I got it ♪

00:04:45.767 --> 00:04:48.567
-♪ He said he can't, he said he
can't, he said he can't ♪

00:04:48.567 --> 00:04:49.667
